---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of Use for bellieacreswine.com — independent Temecula wine-country directory."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-6 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif tracking-tight mb-2 text-stone-900">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 mb-10">Last updated: September 5, 2026 · https://bellieacreswine.com</p>

    <p>
      Welcome to Bellie Acres Wine at <strong>bellieacreswine.com</strong>. By accessing or using this website, you
      agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, do not use the site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      We provide an <strong>independent directory and editorial-style travel information</strong> about Temecula Valley
      wineries, maps, events, and related experiences. Listings, ratings, hours, prices, pet/kid policies, and event
      details can change without notice. Always verify critical details with the business before you visit or book.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Not professional advice</h2>
    <p>
      Content is for general information only. It is not legal, medical, financial, or professional advice, and it is
      not an offer to sell alcohol. Alcohol laws vary; you are responsible for complying with age and DUI laws.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Age and responsible use</h2>
    <p>
      Wine tasting and alcohol consumption are restricted to adults 21+ where required by law. Do not drink and drive.
      Designate a driver, use rideshare, or book transportation if you plan multiple tastings.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      Site design, original text, and branding are owned by us or used under license. You may not copy the site for
      commercial scraping or republication without permission. Third-party marks (winery names, logos if any) belong
      to their owners.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">User conduct</h2>
    <p>You agree not to misuse the site, attempt to disrupt it, scrape it aggressively, or submit unlawful content via contact channels.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Third-party links and ads</h2>
    <p>
      Outbound links and advertisements (including Google AdSense) are provided for convenience. We do not control
      third-party sites or ads and are not responsible for their content, products, or policies.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Featured listings and paid placement</h2>
    <p>
      We may offer paid <strong>Featured Listing</strong> or similar advertising inventory on the directory
      (see <a href="/advertise">/advertise</a>). Featured placement is advertising, not an editorial endorsement,
      star rating, or guarantee of traffic, rankings, or sales. Unless otherwise agreed in writing: (a) each purchase
      covers one business for the stated duration starting on the activation date; (b) activation requires you to
      send complete listing details after payment; (c) we may refuse or remove content that is unlawful, misleading,
      or off-topic for a wine-country visitor directory; (d) full refund is available if we have not activated your
      listing and you request a refund within 7 days of payment; after activation, fees are generally non-refundable
      except where required by law. Payments are processed by Stripe; their terms apply to the checkout transaction.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
    <p>
      THE SITE IS PROVIDED “AS IS” AND “AS AVAILABLE” WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING
      MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. We do not warrant that listings are
      complete, current, or error-free.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, WE ARE NOT LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL,
      OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS OR DATA, ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE SITE OR RELIANCE ON ANY
      LISTING. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM RELATING TO THE SITE IS LIMITED TO USD $50.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Indemnity</h2>
    <p>
      You agree to indemnify and hold us harmless from claims arising out of your misuse of the site or violation of
      these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Governing law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, USA, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:executerceo@gmail.com">executerceo@gmail.com</a> ·
      <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> ·
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
